; source: project import/include regression fixture
; behavior: a library module that imports the well-known cose module; the
; outer file imports the library as `defs` and ALSO imports the same
; well-known cose module directly.  Imports are weak, scope-bound
; references, so the same well-known in two different scopes is not a
; cycle: the inner import becomes `defs.cose.COSE_Key` and the outer
; import becomes `cose.COSE_Key`.  Neither `library` nor
; `defs_cose_key_ref` is referenced from the importer, so the
; well-known-in-different-scope case is exercised by the *directives*
; themselves rather than by reachable rules.

;# import rfc9052 as cose

defs_cose_key_ref = cose.COSE_Key
